              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">An upgrade of Pavisiers (+3 pts): heavy armour and shield replace the pavise and light armour. Thrusting spear, may exchange for halberd (+1 pt). Pavisiers and Voulgiers cannot be used in the same army (not enforced). (Armies of Chivalry p.33)</characteristic>
